      "text": "Distributed Key Value Store: \n\nFR: \n- store key and its value \n\nNFR: \n- tunable consistency\n- durable\n- fault tolerant\n- available\n- highly scalable\n- concurrency/parallel requests\n\n\n\n\n\n",
